  <metadata>
    <name>Ushuaia by UTMB</name>
    <desc>Distance: 100 km | Elevation gain: 4800 m | Profile: mountainous | Surface: trail | Typical date: March | The world&apos;s southernmost UTMB race in Tierra del Fuego. Beech forests (lenga), glacial valleys, and exposed Andean ridgelines above the Beagle Channel. Extremely unpredictable weather.</desc>
    <link href="https://supplme.app"><text>Supplme</text></link>
  </metadata>
